        "slc_4afc09989071d02e5df060341aa6e6aabb4f86d81f3e4d81b1c9f3d606efe81d"
      ],
      "text": "The agent mimics human reasoning with a three-layer approach: layer one finds obvious patterns, layer two filters candidate answers violating patterns, and layer three scores remaining answers by attribute similarity."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_85556d562eeea1c291cc9740bf7b94482a8acef987be36c7a56cdc54594c48ca",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "design-choices",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "b58d9dee36491d3aa7f338955ca2db1c121c1f6a",
          "git_sha": "b9a6b71e84866dcf98463cc7a18f14789eecad91",
          "line_end": 9,
          "line_start": 9,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "teldridge11/rpm-ai-agent",
          "url": "https://github.com/teldridge11/RPM-AI-Agent/blob/b58d9dee36491d3aa7f338955ca2db1c121c1f6a/README.md#L9-L9"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_4afc09989071d02e5df060341aa6e6aabb4f86d81f3e4d81b1c9f3d606efe81d"
      ],
      "text": "Each of the three layers contributes capabilities the others cannot, and combined they reportedly solve problems with high accuracy."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_8b2ce330958ed3e4b79d0223d176c15700cfda812f579caf7ec8ceeaa1e389ef",
